$$\text{Si } \sum_{i=1}^{N} f_{\text{local}}(\omega_i) \geq \int_{\Omega} |(\omega \cdot \nabla) \mathbf{u}| \, d\mathbf{x} \quad \forall t \in [0, T]$$
$$\text{Alors } \|\omega(\cdot, t)\|_{L^\infty} < C \quad \forall t \in [0, T]$$

